Rule 18 (if centered is true and normalized is false, offsets should be within the bounds of the input image considering the size of the glimpses)
{input : tensor, offsets : tensor, centered: bool, normalized: bool, size: tensor} |= if centered ∧ (normalized = false) then (min(offsets) - shape(size, 0)/2 ≥ 0 ∧ min(offsets) - shape(size, 1)/2 ≥ 0 ∧ max(offsets) + shape(size, 0)/2 ≤ shape(input, 1) ∧ max(offsets) + shape(size, 1)/2 ≤ shape(input, 2))
>>
Rule 19 (if centered is true and normalized is false, offsets should be within the bounds of the input image considering the size of the glimpses)
{input : tensor, offsets : tensor, centered: bool, normalized: bool, size: tensor} |= if centered ∧ (normalized = false) then (min(offsets) - (size[0]/2) >= 0 ∧ min(offsets) - (size[1]/2) >= 0 ∧ max(offsets) + (size[0]/2) <= shape(input, 1) ∧ max(offsets) + (size[1]/2) <= shape(input, 2))
>>
Rule 20 (if centered is true and normalized is false, offsets should be within the bounds of the input image considering the size of the glimpses)
{input : tensor, offsets : tensor, centered: bool, normalized: bool, size: tensor} |= if centered ∧ (normalized = false) then (min(offsets) - (size[0] / 2) ≥ 0) ∧ (min(offsets) - (size[1] / 2) ≥ 0) ∧ (max(offsets) + (size[0] / 2) ≤ shape(input, 1)) ∧ (max(offsets) + (size[1] / 2) ≤ shape(input, 2))
